  "summary": "Swedish police were called to central Tenhult at 03:35 on 18 November 2026 after two people were robbed of cryptocurrency in their home, according to a police summary for Jönköping County. The police say perpetrators entered the home, assaulted one of the victims and, under threat, forced them to transfer the currency by computer to another account, then bound the victims before leaving in an unknown direction. Nobody has been arrested. The incident is being investigated as aggravated robbery.",
